# Barbellist — Global Rules

## Tech Stack (Non-Negotiable)
- **Frontend**: Next.js 16 (App Router, React 19, Server Components, Server Actions)
- **Data Layer**: Supabase (PostgreSQL + Auth + Realtime + Storage) via Server Actions and Route Handlers
- **UI Components**: **Mantine UI** (`@mantine/core`, `@mantine/hooks`, `@mantine/form`, `@mantine/notifications`) — primary component library for forms, inputs, buttons, modals, tables, overlays, layout
- **Styling**: **Mantine UI + pure vanilla CSS ONLY**. Use Mantine theme/props/components for UI; use vanilla CSS (`globals.css`, CSS Modules, Mantine `styles`/`createTheme`) for layout, brand surfaces, and custom styling. **NO Tailwind CSS.**
- **Validation**: Zod (frontend forms, Server Actions, Route Handlers)
- **State**: React Query v5 (TanStack Query) for server state, React state for UI state
- **Icons**: Lucide React (or `@tabler/icons-react` when pairing with Mantine)
- **Charts**: Recharts (or `@mantine/charts` when preferred)
- **Deployment**: Cloudflare Pages (frontend), Supabase (database/auth)

